<item>
            <title>[IGNITE-12654] Some of rentingFutures in GridDhtPartitionTopologyImpl may accumulate a huge number of eviction callbacks</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-12654</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Example of heap dump:&lt;/p&gt;
